            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/6781a306ef649dd4b67d9cf40798dccf.webp?t=1634886067\" width=550 height=48 /></span><br><br><strong>Tense Reflection</strong> is an innovative puzzle / shooter where you need to solve puzzles in order to reload your ammo / change the color of your shots.<br><br>In order to win, you must quickly switch between <strong>3 panels</strong> :<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/65590813307867731e02e88c44a904c9.avif?t=1634886067\" width=600 height=220 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/b93ddb45ed0b1bdcd066190c6a0636f3.avif?t=1634886067\" width=600 height=220 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/cf266f921f98163c716704a02f0222d8.avif?t=1634886067\" width=600 height=220 /></span><br>In Tense Reflection, you will never be able to slow down. Keep going, stay focus, and good luck.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/936fd251cd288326d315f7b8bb19df29.webp?t=1634886067\" width=550 height=48 /></span><br><br>The game features a colorblind mode.<br><br>Tense Reflection features musics from the 7 following artists :<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/178e386c58cdb757961936a4a73fba60.avif?t=1634886067\" width=650 height=340 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/ec197d